# OCCTBIM macOS DMG

This is a placeholder for the macOS DMG package.

File: OCCTBIM-macOS-v1.3.0.dmg
Size: ~160MB
Platform: macOS 10.15+ (Intel & Apple Silicon)

To build the actual DMG, you would need:
- macOS development environment
- Xcode and command line tools
- Compiled OCCTBIM binaries
- Dependencies (Qt, OpenCASCADE, etc.)
- DMG creation scripts

Contact: contact@occtbim.com for source code and build instructions.